@prefix ex: <https://example.org/learning/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
ex:Person a rdfs:Class .
ex:Service a rdfs:Class .
ex:Project a rdfs:Class .
ex:maintains a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain ex:Person ; rdfs:range ex:Service .
ex:belongsTo a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain ex:Service ; rdfs:range ex:Project .
